        },
        {
          "text": "Mubuzuba obo mbubonya Ahasuera wakapa Esita namalelo lubono lwa-Hamani, sinkondonyina waba-Juda, Alimwi Moodekai naakaboola kumwami (nkaambo Esita wakamwaambila kuti wakalini kulinguwe), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
