            "sid": "EST 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Esita wakaamba cabili kumwami, kaliwaala kumaulu aakwe amisozi akumukombelezya kuti azime bubi mbwaakacita Hamani mu-Agagi aciyungo ncaakayungila ba-Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.4.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Es 4:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami wakatambika kafunko kangolida kuliEsita, elyo wakafugamuka akwiima kunembo lyamwami, ulati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuti kacibotela mwami, kuti wakondwa mulindime, kuti kaciba ciluzi mumeso aamwami, kuti kandimukonda, kaliba jwi lyakusandamuna zilaililo zyakabambwa a-Hamani mu-Agagi zyaamba lunyonyoono lwaba-Juda muzisi zyoonse zyamwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.2.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 2:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.137.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Int 137:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo ime inga ndilaumuna buti nkembona lunyonyooko luwida mukowa wangu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.13.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tus 13:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami Ahasuera wakati kuliEsita namalelo akuli-Moodekai mu-Juda, Amulange ndilipede Esita lubono lwa-Hamani, bakamwaanzikide acaanzikilo akaambo wakabika maanza kuba-­Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.6.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 6:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TI.2.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tim 2:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino amulembele ba-Juda andinywe mbomuyanda zilaililo nzomuyanda; amulembe muzina lyamwami akucisimba acisimbyo camwami, nkaambo taakwe muntu uukonzya kuzima mulao uulembwa muzina lyamwami akusimbwa alusimbo lwamwami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
