        },
        {
          "text": "Aboobo basimposo bakazwa, kabatantide mabbiza aamwami aakalijisi luno, kabafwambaanizigwa akulailila kwamwami, cilaililo calo kacaambwa kubuleya mu-Susa munzi wamwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
